## E. How to use this file safely

1. **Authenticity:** For any claim of “Antonio Stradivari,” demand certificates from recognized experts (e.g. W.E. Hill & Sons successors, comparable workshops) and match dendrochronology / CT imaging where applicable.  
2. **Label alone:** The phrase “Antonius Stradivarius Cremonensis Faciebat Anno ####” appears on **millions** of factory instruments; it is **not** evidence of a Strad.  
3. **Recheck links:** Marketplace SKUs rotate; auction lots close or relist.

**End of snapshot.**
